  unitName: Deadly Bonnie
  unitId: 840114
  unitNumber: 8117
  description: A young girl from the mysterious world of Paskua who looks suspiciously
    like a rabbit. Appearing as if from out of nowhere, Bonnie showed up in Grand
    Gaia donning a helmet embellished with a skull, and long floppy ears sticking
    out of her head. This, along with other rabbit-like features such as her pom-pom
    tail, led others to become quickly enamoured with her cute features, causing
    her enemies to become easily distracted on the battlefield. Unbeknownst to many,
    Bonnie was actually quite the war machine, wreaking havoc wherever she set foot
    with her cannon beside her. Legend has it that her weapon was forged from an
    indestructible metal that cannot be found anywhere in Grand Gaia, but no conclusive
    evidence regarding this claim has been found.
  summonDesc: Don't underestimate me just because I'm cute! I hit like a cannonball!
  fusionDesc: Cannon loaded,<br>and ready to fire!
